# Versification "Bible Strong EASY": an overlay on bs-eng, for EasyEnglish.
#
# EASY numbers as bs-eng, but prints many rows that stand for several verses (a list of names,
# a census, a refrain), stored on the first number; the numbers that follow have no row. Each
# mapping line sends such a row to every org verse it stands for (Ps 136:4 "…He was wise when he
# made the skies…" is verses 4-9). Where the row ends its chapter, the chapter ends there too.
#
# The lines were read from the published coverage (the verse numbers each chapter has) and
# checked against the texts (docs/research/versification.md, section 2.5).
#
1CH 25:9
2CH 35:26
EZK 36:37
DAN 10:20
ROM 8:38
1CO 5:12
